         "note": "crops 1-2 hold only creases and scanner lines; crop 3 lower panel upright, pencil, no other writing in the crop. Five figures run together with no separators, all five plain: 1 8 1 2 3. Grouped as day-month-year after the convention reading.md gives for 14114, which makes it 18.1.23. The alternative grouping 18.12. would leave a one-figure year, so it is set aside."
